    "item_data_json": "{\"options\":{\"A\":\"Administer the scheduled digoxin, then repeat the potassium level after the next dose of furosemide.\",\"B\":\"Hold furosemide only, give the digoxin, and treat the ventricular ectopy as an unrelated rhythm change.\",\"C\":\"Withhold digoxin, notify the provider, and obtain current digoxin, electrolyte, and renal-function data.\",\"D\":\"Give the digoxin with food and continue routine monitoring because gastrointestinal effects are expected.\"}}",
